{
  "id": "p39",
  "title": "The Hidden Dump in the Parliament Hall",
  "titleZh": "议会大厅里的隐藏废料",
  "topic": "旧议会大厅修复与非法废料",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The eastern parliament meets in a grand old stone hall.",
        "zh": "东部议会在一座宏伟的旧石厅里开会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A major vote will determine the fate of this building.",
        "zh": "一次重要的投票将决定这座建筑的命运。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An annual series of repairs has reached its final stage.",
        "zh": "一年一度的修缮系列已进入最后阶段。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Workers arrange a careful outline of the long project.",
        "zh": "工人们为这个长期项目安排了一份仔细的纲要。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A typical stone platform rests below the main hall.",
        "zh": "一个典型的石制平台位于主厅下方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's firm will restore and transform the painted ceiling.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的公司将修复并改造彩绘天花板。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They appoint a married engineer to lead the daily work.",
        "zh": "他们任命一位已婚工程师来领导日常工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A chemical smell emerges from a crack in the wall.",
        "zh": "一股化学气味从墙上的裂缝中冒出。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then they find three barrel lids beneath a loose fold of stone.",
        "zh": "然后他们在一块松动的石头下发现三个桶盖。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A grave problem becomes visible beside the north wing.",
        "zh": "北翼旁边出现了一个严重的问题。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The first encounter with the waste will appal the whole crew.",
        "zh": "第一次与这些废料相遇会让整个工队感到震惊。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the search, police suspect an illegal dump at this location.",
        "zh": "搜查期间，警方怀疑这个地点有一处非法倾倒。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A commissioner arrives to lead the official safety procedure.",
        "zh": "一位委员赶来领导官方的安全程序。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She has an assured manner and a calm public attitude.",
        "zh": "她举止自信，公开态度平静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her team will chase every clue in the dark depth below.",
        "zh": "她的团队会在下面的黑暗深处追踪每一条线索。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They predict a long inquiry and heavy stress on staff.",
        "zh": "他们预计会有一场漫长的调查，员工将承受沉重的压力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A collective anger begins to roll through the small town.",
        "zh": "一种集体的愤怒开始席卷这座小镇。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin pins a map and a bone fragment on the board.",
        "zh": "我表弟把一张地图和一块骨头碎片钉在板上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The crime may involve a vice ring and a hidden ally.",
        "zh": "这起犯罪可能涉及一个恶习团伙和一名隐藏的盟友。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the governor calls a meeting at midnight.",
        "zh": "后来州长在午夜召集了一次会议。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A spectacular yacht waits near the harbor for the charity tour.",
        "zh": "一艘壮观的游艇在港口附近等待慈善参观。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They plan a night of entertainment and delight for the donors.",
        "zh": "他们为捐助者计划了一个充满娱乐和欢乐的夜晚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One donor will grab the chance to enable the repairs.",
        "zh": "一位捐助者会抓住这个机会，使修缮得以进行。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The overall cost may limit the budget for next year.",
        "zh": "总成本可能会限制明年的预算。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A catholic group chops wood and offers a small hall.",
        "zh": "一个天主教团体劈柴，并提供一个小厅。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their shared vision can give the old room a new personality.",
        "zh": "他们共同的愿景能给这个旧房间带来新的个性。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother feels deep emotion, whereas the clerk stays calm.",
        "zh": "我母亲感到深深的情绪，而那位职员保持平静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "On the eleventh day, a gift ends a bad tendency and restarts production.",
        "zh": "在第十一天，一份礼物结束了一个坏趋势，并重启了生产。"
      }
    ]
  ],
